        "edit": "Fix the two malformed case-item literals in the 3-to-8 decoder: change 3'b100 assignment from 8'b0001_000 to 8'b0001_0000 and 3'b111 assignment from 8'b100_0000 to 8'b1000_0000, so each output bit is correctly one-hot for the selected input.",
